# Local working notes (not tracked)
Session Handoff Summary.md

# The session handoff is the owner's working notes for the *previous* session, not repo
# documentation — it goes stale the moment the next session starts and was being committed
# only by habit. Consolidated 2026-08-22 from four files (a root summary plus three dated
# ones under docs/handoffs/, a folder that no longer exists) into this single rolling doc.
# Anything durable belongs in a tracked document instead, because this file is invisible
# to everyone else — see the migration table inside it.
SESSION_HANDOFF.md

# Local virtualenv
venv/

# Local server run artifacts (not tracked)
/logs/
server.log
server.err

# Local diagnostic scripts (not tracked)
scripts/diag_*.py

# One-off diagnostic and repro scripts written during live debugging. They hardcode
# this machine's paths (/mnt/c/dev/...) and compose-derived container names, so they
# are meaningful only on the box that wrote them — the same reasoning that already
# excludes scripts/diag_*.py above. 68 of them had been committed.
scratchpad/

# Local secrets — never commit (real API keys live here)
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Nodus execution scratch — per-run graph/checkpoint records written by the workflow
# engine on every local run. Nothing reads them back (no code references the path);
# they accumulated silently because there was no rule, arriving in unrelated PRs.
/.nodus/
